Real workloads are multi-tenant; tail latency for latency-sensitive apps matters; this tests practical scheduling, fairness, and locality.

## Key Concepts

- I/O scheduling and fairness
- Per-container quotas and tokens
- Data locality and NUMA-aware dispatch
- Lock-free queues and CAS for race-free updates
- Burst handling and starvation prevention

